"""Tests for the TimesFM forecast API in ``sktime.libs.timesfm.timesfm``.

The production module depends on jax, paxml/praxis and utilsforecast, which are
optional and unavailable in the test environment.  These are external boundaries
(accelerator runtime, pre-trained checkpoint plumbing, dataframe helper of a
third-party package), so they are replaced by small, deterministic in-memory
substitutes.  The behaviour of the target module itself - input validation,
preprocessing, batching, postprocessing and dataframe plumbing - is exercised
unchanged.
"""

